    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="380b7eca-cf06-5d3a-9519-445d1421266a" activityNameId="5db40a28-66fa-52e8-abd9-93d68998ac0f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heavy fuel oil, burned in industrial furnace 1MW, non-modulating</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in industrial furnace 1MW, non-modulating
Inventory for the operation of an oil boiler, data related to fuel input. 5*000 hours of usage estimated per year.;
Synonyms: Schweröl, HFO; 
UUID: 8da866f1-f25d-305f-81ab-fa95dd2d25de
Direct air emissions from combustion, including infrastructure, fuel consumption, waste and auxiliary electricity use.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Average non-modulating, non-condensing furnace used in 2016.
Time period: New data for regulated emissions like NOx, particles, other figures are partly based on older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in literature based on measurements. 
Extrapolations: Some information from other European countries has been used to determine the emission factors.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_8da866f1-f25d-305f-81ab-fa95dd2d25de.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
